---
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="dbos-row">
    <span class="tag tag--muted">DBOS · @DBOS.step</span>
    <div class="opaque">
      <code>openai.chat.completions.create(prompt=&hellip;)</code>
      <span class="dim">OTel traces via instrumentation. You own alias resolution and secrets.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="record">
    <div class="record-head">
      <span class="tag tag--accent">ZenML · @step</span>
      <span class="mono exec">step: research · run 9f2a&hellip;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mono-call">
      <span class="fn">log_metadata</span>(<span class="str">metadata=</span>&#123;<span class="val">"tokens"</span>: n&#125;)
    </div>

    <dl class="fields">
      <div>
        <dt>artifact</dt>
        <dd class="mono">brief &middot; v4 &middot; stored on the run</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>metadata</dt>
        <dd class="mono">whatever you log on the step</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="chip">
          <span class="chip-k">tokens</span><span class="chip-v">1,247</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chip">
          <span class="chip-k">latency</span><span class="chip-v">2.8s</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chip">
          <span class="chip-k">cost</span><span class="chip-v">$0.028</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <div class="replay">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 12 A9 9 0 1 0 6 5 L3 8 M3 3 L3 8 L8 8" />
      </svg>
      <span>The step is the unit of record: its return value is versioned, and metadata you log attaches to the run.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .tag--muted {
    background: var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-cream-700);
  }
  .tag--accent {
    background: var(--color-sage-200);
    color: var(--color-sage-800);
  }

  .dbos-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--color-cream-50);
  }
  .opaque {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .opaque code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-cream-700);
  }
  .opaque .dim {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-cream-700);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .record {
    padding: 16px 18px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sage-500);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--color-card);

  }
  .record-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .exec {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-cream-700);
  }
  .mono-call {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--color-cream-900);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-cream-50);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .fn { color: var(--color-sage-800); font-weight: 600; }
  .str { color: var(--color-cream-700); }
  .val { color: var(--color-sage-800); }

  .fields { margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .fields > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .fields dt {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--color-cream-700);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fields dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--color-cream-900);
    padding: 6px 10px;
    background: var(--color-sage-200);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .fields .mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .fields > div.row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-card);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .chip-k { color: var(--color-cream-700); font-weight: 600; text-transform: none; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .chip-v {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-cream-900);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .replay {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-cream-700);
  }
  .replay svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-sage-600);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
</style>
